{"parse":{"title":"Cleansing for the Spring","pageid":395631,"revid":2088973,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Cleansing for the Spring</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/99/Talent_Cleansing_for_the_Spring.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024344\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Cleansing for the Spring\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/99/Talent_Cleansing_for_the_Spring.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024344\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/99/Talent_Cleansing_for_the_Spring.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024344 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/99/Talent_Cleansing_for_the_Spring.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024344 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Cleansing for the Spring\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Cleansing_for_the_Spring.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Cleansing for the Spring.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Each point of <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a> Lauma has will give her the following bonuses:<br /><ul><li> DMG dealt by her Elemental Skill is increased by 0.04%. The maximum increase obtainable this way is 32%.</li><li> The cooldown of her Charged Attack Spirit Envoy Metamorphosis is reduced by 0.02%. The maximum reduction obtainable this way is 20%.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Bonus\" title=\"DMG Bonus\">DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CD_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CD Reduction\">CD Reduction</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Cleansing for the Spring</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCleansing_for_the_Spring%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Cleansing for the Spring</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">奉向甘泉的沐濯</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Fèngxiàng Gānquán de Mùzhuó</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">The Cleansing Offered to the Sweet Spring</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">奉向甘泉的沐濯</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Fèngxiàng Gānquán de Mùzhuó</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><s